  6985                                  ; 200h bits 8-11); reg 207h bit 11 write-enables the EC000-EFFFF block while the bytes are patched.
  6986                                  ; The option-ROM checksum byte at EE00:1FFF is recomputed so scan_option_roms accepts the image.
